          "messageType": "procedureCategorySelected",
          "pageScope": true,
          "script": "\n\tsystem.perspective.print(\"procedureCategorySelected msg rcvd with payload \" + str(payload))\n\t\n\tprocedureCategoryId \u003d None\n\tif len(payload[\u0027selection\u0027]) \u003e 0: \n\t\tprocedureCategoryId \u003d payload[\u0027selection\u0027][0][\u0027procedureCategoryId\u0027]\n\t\tprocedureCategoryName \u003d payload[\u0027selection\u0027][0][\u0027procedureCategoryName\u0027]\n\t\tprocedureCategoryPath \u003d payload[\u0027selection\u0027][0][\u0027procedureCategoryPath\u0027]\n\t\n\tself.view.custom.procedureInfo.procedureCategoryId \u003d procedureCategoryId\n\tself.view.custom.procedureInfo.procedureCategoryName \u003d procedureCategoryName\n\tself.view.custom.procedureInfo.procedureCategoryPath \u003d procedureCategoryPath\n\t\n\treturn",
